# Mutation plan for the sixteen `api4/access_control.go` routes and their local twins —
# `crates/mm-api/src/access_control_policies.rs`, `crates/mm-app/src/access_control_policy.rs`
# and `crates/mm-store/src/access_control_policy_store.rs`.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/abac.plan
#
# Every route ends in the nil-service 501, so what the suite pins is the order and the shape of
# the gates in front of it: which rung a delegated admin passes, what the store says about
# ownership, and the one write on this build (the team-scope reconcile). Permission *names* are
# not on the wire ([D-092]), so no line swaps one for another; each line moves a status, an id,
# or a row the suite reads back. The two controls are a contiguous rename and a swap of two
# registrations with different paths.
